---
description:
  Checks that a transition between a composite state and a state inside it is
  drawn as a visible loop from the composite's side border, in both directions
  and for a state nested two levels down (#416).
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Outer
  state Outer {
    state Mid {
      Deep --> Deeper
    }
    Deep --> Outer
  }
  Start --> Deep
  Deeper --> End
  Outer --> Deeper
  Mid --> Deep
